ulcanizates, acrylonitrile butadiene co-polymer latex, polychloroprene latex, styrene butadiene co-polymer latex, carbon blacks, functional fillers, nueberg silaceous earths, naphthenic oils, and polymeric plasticizers. In addition, the company offers aliphatic/aromatic hydrocarbon resins, apha polyolefin/polypropylene waxes, antioxidants/anti-ozonants, flow promoters, homogenizing agents, polymer bound dispersions, styrenated phenols, vulcanized vegetable oils, and vulcanizing agents. The company was formerly known as Puneet Resins Limited and changed its name to Rishiroop Limited in August 2015. Rishiroop Limited was incorporated in 1984 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India."}}